  "description": "Framework-agnostic core for fluent log assertions over Microsoft.Extensions.Logging.Testing.FakeLogCollector. Provides ILogRecordFilter + LogFilter composable filter primitives, the failure-message rendering, the FakeLogCollector inspection extensions (Filter, CountMatching, DumpTo), and the LogCollectorBuilder factory. Test-framework-specific entry points live in adapter packages (LogAssertions.TUnit ships today; xUnit, NUnit, MSTest adapters are possible if there is demand).",
